{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/209195-an-inferno-demon-and-an-unchained-walk-into-a-room","id":209195,"title":"An Inferno demon and an Unchained walk into a room..","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-26T01:47:17-07:00","id":209195,"title":"An Inferno demon and an Unchained walk into a room..","content":"Both sit at opposite sides of the table, and simultaneously address the other.<br /> <br /> &quot;I want to make a deal.&quot;<br /> <br /> What happens? Inferno demons have some fun abilities as far as pacts go that Unchained don't. Inferno demons can grant supernatural abilities/power stats for other splats. Attribute Dots, skill dots. Would you allow them to do the same for Unchained?<br /> <br /> Would Unchained have any kind of bonus in the negotiations due to their nature? How would you run it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T04:01:24-07:00","id":209259,"title":"","content":"The bartender says, &quot;What is this, a joke?&quot;<br /> <br /> Taking Cover from a dominion would make you pretty scary.<br /> <br /> Is the Dragon's Tongue covered under the linguistic capabilities of the Unchained? Is the Dragon's Tongue the native language of dominions, or do they have a &quot;native&quot; language? Knowing the Dragon's Tongue simplifies the summoning process.<br /> <br /> A pact with a diabolus would definitely be an interesting way to increase Primum. Embeds and Exploits seem to me like they could go either way, but what I would do is disallow the endowment of Embeds or Exploits, but allow the diabolus to bestow additional demonic form abilities beyond the Unchained's normal capability, and allow the diabolus to further your knowledge of how to advance your Cipher. Of course, would doing so itself alter the course of your Cipher...?<br /> <br /> New Agenda: Infernalists, those Unchained who have found a Hell waiting to swallow them, and need only the power and debasement necessary to come reign there. They are not well liked, but they periodically form alliances of conveniences with demons of other Agendas.<br /> <br /> Tangential fun fax: the centerpiece dude on the cover of Demon: the Descent is taken directly from a chapter splash illustration in Inferno.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T05:01:19-07:00","id":209269,"title":"","content":"Can Unchained generate Faith?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T05:20:32-07:00","id":209274,"title":"","content":"Faith is from Demon: the Fallen, not World of Darkness: Inferno, and answering that question takes you into some deep setting mythos territory. Is Faith a property of a living, breathing human creation, or is the vivid feeling nature of the Unchained enough to make irrelevant the quantum union of flesh and identity they possess in place of a soul? I'd probably go with the latter just to make things more interesting, but enthralling oneself to a divine being once again can't be good for your Primum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T05:27:19-07:00","id":209276,"title":"","content":"Faith is the system found in <i>Demon: the Fallen</i> which is part of the old World of Darkness. Both <i>World of Darkness: Inferno </i>and <i>Demon: the Descent </i>are part of the modern World of Darkness. In these games, to my knowledge, Faith is not a mechanic and so the answer would be: no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T13:33:42-07:00","id":209500,"title":"","content":"Derail: Loserman, I love the idea of Infernalists, flesh it out! Like a Scelesti Agenda that putrefies your interlocks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T21:46:56-07:00","id":209826,"title":"","content":"Well one thing I'm not sure of is if infernal demons would have any interest in the unchained.<br /> <br /> As inferno mentions, the infernal are creatures of sin, they want morality traits to lower. Cover isn't really a morality trait, while a police manhunt would be a pain, a demon might have a rapist serial killer trying to start a genocidal race war as a level 10 cover. <br /> <br /> Gameplay wise it would be problematic too. Unchained makes a soul pact, take the person, and then spend that cover on infernal power? Really unbalanced unless the pact only applies to a specific cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-26T23:17:19-07:00","id":209864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/209195-an-inferno-demon-and-an-unchained-walk-into-a-room?p=209826#post209826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well one thing I'm not sure of is if infernal demons would have any interest in the unchained.<br /> <br /> As inferno mentions, the infernal are creatures of sin, they want morality traits to lower. Cover isn't really a morality trait, while a police manhunt would be a pain, a demon might have a rapist serial killer trying to start a genocidal race war as a level 10 cover.<br /> <br /> Gameplay wise it would be problematic too. Unchained makes a soul pact, take the person, and then spend that cover on infernal power? Really unbalanced unless the pact only applies to a specific cover.</div> </div> </div> </div>They might not care about the degeneration of any given Unchained, but Inferno also mentions that their main desire is to see their influence/vice spread - and that's something that Unchained can certainly help facilitate.<br /> Another question: Can Unchained offer an Inferno Demon one of the Soul Pacts he holds? What would that be worth? Inferno is clear that <i>most</i> demons can't do anything with souls, but what about the ones that <i>can</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-27T22:53:59-07:00","id":210888,"title":"","content":"Correction: It must have been too damn long since I read Inferno. lol<br /> <br /> A soul pact might be good for a deadly sacrifice, since that requires someone being given to the inferno &quot;mind, body, and soul.&quot; <br /> <br /> Still it would need to controlled, soul pacts are something that the setting suggests some demons have plenty of, and even major sacrifices can be nothing more than an inconvenience. An unchained gives up a hand for a major sacrifice, they can still have one more more covers with both hands.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 07-28-2014, 10:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-30T13:42:46-07:00","id":213941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/209195-an-inferno-demon-and-an-unchained-walk-into-a-room?p=209259#post209259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New Agenda: Infernalists, those Unchained who have found a Hell waiting to swallow them, and need only the power and debasement necessary to come reign there. They are not well liked, but they periodically form alliances of conveniences with demons of other Agendas.</div> </div> </div> </div>You looked for my Fallen Agenda? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/213767-more-classical-demons-and-angels-setting-hack?p=213877#post213877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Fallen</b></span></div><div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Better to reign in Hell, then serve in Heavan</i></span></div><br /> <br /> Demons are sinners. They sinned against God-Machine as angels, and were cast away in return. They sin to protect they Covers, or sin against them. And they sin like any other human, even if they aren\u2019t ones. Truly, to be a demon, is to be slave to the sin. Fallen are it\u2019s masters.<br /> <br /> In World of Darkness, sin is power. People feel better if they do \u201cbad things\u201d in name of they Vice. Monsters of the night rave in they darker side, gaining strength in return. Fallen are demons that after rebelion against God-Machine were confronted with existence as creature of Vice. After the Fall, they could empower by serving it. Also, sinning is so sweet.<br /> <br /> And then they find there is literal Hell. Not metaphorical dimension of freedom most demons looking for. But real, Old Testament type Hell. Many call it Inferno. But to Fallen it\u2019s called home. Or at least they want to. For now, it\u2019s place were they Demon Prince patrons live.<br /> <br /> Those ancient beings, old as humanity itself, are very interested in once angels, now demons.They send they lesser servants, spirits, ghosts and other things transformed by the sins they serve. And those massangers are preaching to Unchained so they coud join in Inferno. Some of them do. And so Fall lead to the Fallen.<br /> <br /> But of course they don't forget about God-Machine. As false tyrant that once rules they lives, it should be stopped. Or at least every beautiful angel he makes been brought to Inferno's Hosts. And Fallen will make them Fall.<br /> <br /> <b>The Descent:</b> Most Unchained wants freedom. They look for Hell in what there aren\u2019t any masters and slaves, only themselves. But without other beings, there isn\u2019t any sociaty, there isn\u2019t hierarchy. <i>Hell is empty and all the devils are here</i> - like they say. But Fallen don\u2019t want to be alone. As once angels, they crave for belonging, orders, purpose. But they can\u2019t return to the God-Machine. They found human side in themselves, individuality, identity.They don\u2019t want to loose those precious gifts of Fall. And so they decide they will reign in literall Hell instead.<br /> <br /> Fallen are both masters and slaves. They work for one of the great Patrons, doing \u201chis work\u201d. But always dreaming on the day when they walk in to Inferno, and took the throne for themselves. They will finally be those that send commands, not obeying them.<br /> <br /> But for now, they join with rest of Unchained. They forging Vice in to powerful tool of they both inner strength and influence on others, They preach to demons about they own free will, and that they should rule. They tempt angels in to Fall. And of course, they hide outside of eyes of God-Machine, as it hunts the like the rest of the kind. But at least they have purpose in they life. Someday, when they will be powerful enough, they will Descent in to Inferno and be it\u2019s masters. Now will they gather the sins of the world.<br /> <br /> <b>Organization:</b> Fallen join in loose cults dedicated to one of Patrons. They idealise Seven Deadly Sins, working to sustain it in the world, and by it, empowering themselves for they Descent. From time to time they make loose alliances between cults, especially, as they local mission dictates help from in name of many sins.<br /> <br /> Demon Prince Patrons of Fallen in Inferno:<ul><li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucifer\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer</a>: Pride</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mammon\" target=\"_blank\">Mammon</a>: Greed</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asmodai\" target=\"_blank\">Asmodeus</a>: Lust</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leviathan\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan</a>: Envy</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beelzebub\" target=\"_blank\">Beelzebub</a>: Gluttony</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Satan\" target=\"_blank\">Satan</a>: Wrath</li> <li><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belphegor\" target=\"_blank\">Belphegor</a>: Sloth</li> </ul>But outside they misions, they are totally free. Most join rest of Unchained in they rings, becoming priest- or advisor-like figures, encouraging individuality and free reign of demons. Of course, they play and scheme they on they're comrades, but helping them in the way none the less.<br /> <br /> Many Fallen are ones Integrators, now converted when they see that beside God-Machine they will be only soulless drones at best, destroyed at worst. Confronted with existence of Inferno, they choose they own side. Now have order and missions they lingered, but also work on they own terms. They will join hierarchy, once more, only it is they who would be in charge of it.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Sterotypes</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Inqusitors:</b> Your knowledge don\u2019t lead you to power, if you don\u2019t take actions.<br /> <b>Integrators:</b> Our misguided brothers and sisters, it\u2019s pity you still don\u2019t see your are just slaves.<br /> <b>Saboteures:</b> Still playing this silly wargame with God-Machine? Your choice, but I\u2019m focused on more grander undertacking right now.<br /> <b>Tempters:</b> Hedonism is good, but you still need commitment to achieve something.<br /> <b>Vampires:</b><br /> <b>Werewolves:</b> One needless rage is a tool in others great plan.<br /> <b>Mages:</b> You command the \u201cdemons\u201d, yet you can\u2019t master your own sins.<br /> <b>Changlings:</b><br /> <b>Human:</b></div> </div> </div> </div>More of it in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/213767-more-classical-demons-and-angels-setting-hack\">this topic</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}